  "trigger_name": "Mandatory Report",
  "summary_html": "**Mandatory reporters** (in Delaware, any person, agency, organization, or entity — 16 Del. C. § 903(a)) must report suspected child abuse or neglect. Federal law sets the funding and policy floor (CAPTA) and mandates reporter frameworks on federal lands/facilities (VICAA).",
  "authority_html": "- **CAPTA (42 U.S.C. §§ 5101–5116)** — federal floor for state reporting systems  \n- **Victims of Child Abuse Act (34 U.S.C. §§ 20301–20307)** — includes federal-facility reporter duties (recodified from former 42 U.S.C. §13031)",
