          "holding": "The Superior Court dismissed the common-law duty claims against physicians and the Medical Society, holding that Delaware's Medical Practice Act and Child Abuse Prevention Act reporting statutes do not create a new affirmative tort duty to report and cannot support negligence per se absent a pre-existing common-law duty.",
